1942		$f$ is affine in the line parameter, so in either case
1943		$f \in \deg_d(\ell)$. Chaining Lemmas~\ref{lem:claim-17-1},
1944		\ref{lem:claim-17-2} and~\ref{lem:claim-17-3} with the triangle
